  "amendment_before_any_counterfactual_label": "Shared event-triggered horizon avoids comparing unequal future lengths and avoids replaying SKIP until sequence end merely because its bank entry is intentionally absent. Trigger remains actual live WRITE-branch READ, not baseline categories or fixed H8. Identity target and rank/latency terms are declared before labels: editing a bank must assess that bank identity, and rank changes must refer to its GT target queries rather than background detections.",
